don School of Economics and Political Science. The authors would also like to thank the United Kingdom Department for International Development for their funding of the research team, which has also contributed to the writing of this article. SP would like to acknowledge the Economic and Social Research Council Post Doctoral Fellowship Award PTA-026-27-0250, which allowed him the time to contribute to the writing of this article. The views expressed in this article are those of the authors and do not necessarily reflect those of UNICEF, the Economic and Social Research Council, or the Department for International Development.</p></fn><fn id="n2" fn-type="conflict"><p><bold>Competing Interests:</bold> The authors have declared that no competing interests exist.</p></fn></fn-group></back></article>